<section class="mt-7" aria-label="Why hearts and wearables care">
  <div class="mt-7 grid items-start gap-6 min-[46rem]:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(18rem,0.9fr)]">
    <p class="leading-relaxed text-white/80">A heart monitor or biomedical wearable can look at an ECG, which is a trace of the heart’s electrical activity. A human heartbeat creates a brief burst of activity, followed by quieter stretches. The signal is not equally busy every moment.</p>
    <div class="grid gap-4">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
        <figure class="flex min-h-40 items-center justify-center">
          <img
            class="max-h-48 w-full object-contain"
